    "Storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "存储空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stories whose title or summary mentions one of these words are hidden in the widgets and in the TechNews window. English words match whole words, so “AI” doesn't hide “said”." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标题或摘要中含有这些词的新闻，在小组件和 TechNews 窗口里都会被隐藏。英文按整个单词匹配，所以屏蔽“AI”不会隐藏含“said”的新闻。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Story order" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新闻顺序"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "跟随系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tech Headlines" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "科技资讯"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The widgets keep the latest headlines and small pictures so they can show news right away. The cache stays under about 400 KB and deletes anything older than 3 days by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "小组件会保存最新的新闻和小尺寸图片，以便立即显示。缓存始终不超过约 400 KB，超过 3 天的内容会自动删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The widgets keep updating even when TechNews isn't open." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "即使不打开 TechNews，小组件也会自动更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The widgets then download fresh headlines and pictures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "之后小组件会重新下载新闻和图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top Stories First" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重要新闻优先"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top Stories First puts the stories that several outlets report on the first page. Applies to the widgets and the TechNews window." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“重要新闻优先”会把多家媒体都在报道的新闻放在第一页。对小组件和 TechNews 窗口都生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
